WEBVTT

1
00:00:05,100 --> 00:00:08,300
As expected, they all came here for my divine domain data.

2
00:00:08,700 --> 00:00:12,970
Special invitation from the Eight Swordsmen and the Supreme Command of the Spark Legion

3
00:00:25,070 --> 00:00:26,270
Hello, classmate Lin Yuan

4
00:00:26,270 --> 00:00:28,870
I am the commander-in-chief of the Jiangcheng Theater of the Spark Corps

5
00:00:28,870 --> 00:00:33,070
Xiao Lie, Raymond and Major General Chen Yan, who sent you the abyss worm, have already told me about your situation.

6
00:00:33,070 --> 00:00:35,870
Well done. Those officers want your plainclothes work.

7
00:00:35,870 --> 00:00:39,070
They think as long as they get the data, they can mass-produce cheap running backs.

8
00:00:39,070 --> 00:00:42,670
But I know that the kind of model ecology that can reach the extreme cannot be copied.

9
00:00:42,670 --> 00:00:44,670
Forcing the glass will only result in a pile of rotten meat

10
00:00:44,670 --> 00:00:46,670
So we don't want your recipe

11
00:00:46,670 --> 00:00:50,850
As long as you are this person

12
00:00:50,850 --> 00:00:51,850
little general

13
00:00:51,850 --> 00:00:54,850
If you also want me, Qian Xin, to be so angry

14
00:00:54,850 --> 00:00:56,850
Then you may be disappointed
